{"data":[{"author_id":"1745106082790318080","created_at":"2026-10-13T19:01:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110083449633558951"],"id":"2110083449633558951","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":12319,"like_count":34,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":0},"text":"As the need for training and inference infrastructure grows rapidly, there is demand for increased campus sizes, with the growth mandating campus links have 5 km reach or more. Full Coherent systems are predominantly used in long-haul communications, which ends up being overkill","url":"https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2110083449633558951"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2110077622726037504"]},"author_id":"4783690002","created_at":"2026-10-13T18:41:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110078384617464201"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":144,"id":"792359016592584704","start":134,"username":"Apptronik"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/JIyoKnVc4q","end":213,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/GoogleDeepMind/status/2110078384617464201/video/1","media_key":"13_2110077622726037504","start":190,"url":"https://t.co/JIyoKnVc4q"}]},"id":"2110078384617464201","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":121,"impression_count":62372,"like_count":903,"quote_count":41,"reply_count":102,"retweet_count":107},"text":"Gemini 4 Argon taught a robot to play cornhole just by watching a video.\n\nIt mapped the physics, coded its own simulation, and taught @Apptronik's Apollo humanoid to sink 7 throws in a row. https://t.co/JIyoKnVc4q","url":"https://x.com/GoogleDeepMind/status/2110078384617464201"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110073003086159872"]},"author_id":"2939913921","created_at":"2026-10-13T18:21:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110073543387996431"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/5k2RRcRnk5","end":291,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/natolambert/status/2110073543387996431/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110073003086159872","start":268,"url":"https://t.co/5k2RRcRnk5"},{"display_url":"x.com/natolambert/st…","end":315,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/natolambert/status/2108954173316178231","start":292,"url":"https://t.co/MP03FjHaTs"}]},"id":"2110073543387996431","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":6413,"like_count":42,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":6},"text":"A gap that has been fixed in our methodology that highlighted a decline was not including local models (GGUF, AWQ, ONNX, etc). Earlier, these were far harder to track and closer to a rounding error. Now, they're surging. We updated our pipeline to track these models! https://t.co/5k2RRcRnk5 https://t.co/MP03FjHaTs","url":"https://x.com/natolambert/status/2110073543387996431"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2110057465882820608"]},"author_id":"2465283662","created_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110057543305396244"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"Join the discussion on this paper page","display_url":"huggingface.co/papers/2610.12…","end":108,"expanded_url":"https://huggingface.co/papers/2610.12369","images":[{"height":648,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2108568183426936834/VrQNJ267?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1200},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2108568183426936834/VrQNJ267?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":85,"status":200,"title":"Paper page - Embodied Turing Machines: Stateful Code for Robot Recursive Self-Improvement","unwound_url":"https://huggingface.co/papers/2610.12369","url":"https://t.co/hZTIxKkmrN"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/2aqlUyhkIx","end":132,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/_akhaliq/status/2110057543305396244/video/1","media_key":"13_2110057465882820608","start":109,"url":"https://t.co/2aqlUyhkIx"}]},"id":"2110057543305396244","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":17,"impression_count":5150,"like_count":20,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":4},"text":"Embodied Turing Machines\n\nStateful Code for Robot Recursive Self-Improvement\n\npaper: https://t.co/hZTIxKkmrN https://t.co/2aqlUyhkIx","url":"https://x.com/_akhaliq/status/2110057543305396244"},{"author_id":"1482581556","created_at":"2026-10-13T16:59:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110052931110318464"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"REAL GENIUS is NOW PLAYING and can be found to Rent or Buy here: bi...","display_url":"youtu.be/G-gAbSQGGqM?si…","end":270,"expanded_url":"https://youtu.be/G-gAbSQGGqM?si=6NQue5-ulgGedGrt&t=50","images":[{"height":720,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2110052935107538944/4cb1RUCf?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1280},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2110052935107538944/4cb1RUCf?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":247,"status":200,"title":"Val Kilmer Has a Breakthrough | Real Genius (1985) | Now Playing","unwound_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?si=6NQue5-ulgGedGrt&t=50&v=G-gAbSQGGqM&feature=youtu.be","url":"https://t.co/A7BKAJDJhm"},{"display_url":"x.com/demishassabis/…","end":294,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/demishassabis/status/2110041008100843835","start":271,"url":"https://t.co/dpj3TAeK6m"}]},"id":"2110052931110318464","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":79,"impression_count":72073,"like_count":787,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":51,"retweet_count":40},"text":"I love lasers (really wanted to work on them as a kid)… especially Argon lasers 😀 reminded me of this scene from one of my fave films: ‘synthesize excited bromide in an argon matrix… but that would be hotter than the sun’ 😂 Val Kilmer was so cool https://t.co/A7BKAJDJhm https://t.co/dpj3TAeK6m","url":"https://x.com/demishassabis/status/2110052931110318464"},{"author_id":"1353836358901501952","created_at":"2026-10-13T16:36:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110047081414987957"],"id":"2110047081414987957","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8270,"impression_count":1737228,"like_count":11145,"quote_count":716,"reply_count":524,"retweet_count":873},"text":"New on our Engineering blog: Creating in-house source control. \n\nIn May, we merged around 2,500 code changes per day. In September, we merged more than 30,000 per day. As a result, we became bottlenecked by developer infrastructure built for human (rather than agent) scale.","url":"https://x.com/AnthropicAI/status/2110047081414987957"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2110040604264820737"]},"author_id":"1482581556","created_at":"2026-10-13T16:12:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110041008100843835"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/nVADBiXYDe","end":308,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/demishassabis/status/2110041008100843835/video/1","media_key":"13_2110040604264820737","start":285,"url":"https://t.co/nVADBiXYDe"}]},"id":"2110041008100843835","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":429,"impression_count":170907,"like_count":3123,"quote_count":64,"reply_count":221,"retweet_count":298},"text":"Gemini 4 Argon is amazing for knowledge work and coding - and it’s super fun to build with! We asked it to create this wizard chess game and it's so cool to see Argon's physics understanding &amp; 3D modelling capabilities, makes me nostalgic for Battlechess on the Amiga - fun times! https://t.co/nVADBiXYDe","url":"https://x.com/demishassabis/status/2110041008100843835"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2110036236744237056"]},"author_id":"4783690002","created_at":"2026-10-13T16:05:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110039274922131792"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/N8tOQjwk0x","end":220,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/GoogleDeepMind/status/2110039274922131792/video/1","media_key":"13_2110036236744237056","start":197,"url":"https://t.co/N8tOQjwk0x"}]},"id":"2110039274922131792","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":907,"impression_count":874290,"like_count":4226,"quote_count":277,"reply_count":228,"retweet_count":421},"text":"Gemini 4 Argon is now globally available.\n\nBuilt to solve your hardest problems from start to finish, the model brings frontier capabilities across coding, enterprise workflows, and cyber defense. https://t.co/N8tOQjwk0x","url":"https://x.com/GoogleDeepMind/status/2110039274922131792"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2110033955000872960"]},"author_id":"4783690002","created_at":"2026-10-13T15:46:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110034327111131168"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/oADallGYuR","end":23,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/GoogleDeepMind/status/2110034327111131168/video/1","media_key":"13_2110033955000872960","start":0,"url":"https://t.co/oADallGYuR"}]},"id":"2110034327111131168","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":164,"impression_count":159950,"like_count":3174,"quote_count":137,"reply_count":163,"retweet_count":270},"text":"https://t.co/oADallGYuR","url":"https://x.com/GoogleDeepMind/status/2110034327111131168"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110023393336508416"]},"author_id":"1745106082790318080","created_at":"2026-10-13T15:02:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110023395949629847"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/rcPK0RNFaX","end":296,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2110023395949629847/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110023393336508416","start":273,"url":"https://t.co/rcPK0RNFaX"}]},"id":"2110023395949629847","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":20,"impression_count":17556,"like_count":67,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":3},"text":"As interposers and substrates approach their scaling limits, 2.5D packaging is moving toward 3.5D, with tighter D2D pitch, higher bandwidth density, and lower energy per bit to overcome reticle-driven constraints on lateral scaling.\n\nHigher integration density makes yield https://t.co/rcPK0RNFaX","url":"https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2110023395949629847"},{"author_id":"2939913921","created_at":"2026-10-13T14:46:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110019225305661476"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":63,"id":"2056107995206164480","start":49,"username":"trillium_labs"}]},"id":"2110019225305661476","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":654,"impression_count":42385,"like_count":885,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":44,"retweet_count":60},"text":"We're hiring across many roles at Trillium Labs, @trillium_labs, to build the open scientific ecosystem for LLMs. Most important hires right now (ideally with start dates soon):\n* Full time post-training researchers\n* Engineers with experience with popular open-source libraries","url":"https://x.com/natolambert/status/2110019225305661476"},{"author_id":"2939913921","created_at":"2026-10-13T13:38:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110002173732077632"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/anthropicai/st…","end":303,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/anthropicai/status/2109795898909950247","start":280,"url":"https://t.co/nQwtDgMnbK"}]},"id":"2110002173732077632","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":32,"impression_count":16759,"like_count":251,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":28,"retweet_count":14},"text":"It’s bizarre to me how much noise anthropic made asking for regulatory help before doing this. Hopefully can be a conversation reset now. \n\nWas doubly bizarre bc they emphasized the security risk of learning harmful behaviors from their leaky api. If API is unsafe don’t host it. https://t.co/nQwtDgMnbK","url":"https://x.com/natolambert/status/2110002173732077632"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109841572929892352"]},"author_id":"1745106082790318080","created_at":"2026-10-13T03:00:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109841575547211955"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/sjy6rYywA4","end":300,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2109841575547211955/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109841572929892352","start":277,"url":"https://t.co/sjy6rYywA4"}]},"id":"2109841575547211955","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":140,"impression_count":58770,"like_count":607,"quote_count":17,"reply_count":54,"retweet_count":53},"text":"ALERT🚨: AMD JUST LANDED SUPPORT FOR MEGAKERNEL DECODE IN UPSTREAM VLLM WELL BEFORE NVIDIA. This marks one of the first times that a major vLLM feature is only supported on ROCm and not on CUDA yet.\n\nMegaKernels is a technique that is massively important for high-interactivity https://t.co/sjy6rYywA4","url":"https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2109841575547211955"},{"author_id":"1482581556","created_at":"2026-10-13T01:09:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109813775377563908"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":130,"id":"27013292","start":120,"username":"TheLancet"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/sundarpichai/s…","end":161,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/sundarpichai/status/2108329198955958339","start":138,"url":"https://t.co/Jq0G4D6Cx2"}]},"id":"2109813775377563908","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":197,"impression_count":85264,"like_count":1368,"quote_count":13,"reply_count":87,"retweet_count":109},"text":"Amazing to see research move from the lab to real-world clinical utility - congrats to the team on this milestone &amp; @TheLancet paper! https://t.co/Jq0G4D6Cx2","url":"https://x.com/demishassabis/status/2109813775377563908"},{"author_id":"1353836358901501952","created_at":"2026-10-12T23:58:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109795898909950247"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"Illicit distillation allows model developers to copy frontier AI capabilities without creating proportionally robust safeguards. Here, we describe how we’ve reduced the rate of distillation by more than 90%.","display_url":"anthropic.com/research/disti…","end":182,"expanded_url":"https://www.anthropic.com/research/distillation-defenses","images":[{"height":630,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2109795901023961088/Olhzdqds?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1200},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2109795901023961088/Olhzdqds?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":159,"status":200,"title":"Strengthening our defenses against distillation attacks","unwound_url":"https://www.anthropic.com/research/distillation-defenses","url":"https://t.co/uWiRSLBuOS"}]},"id":"2109795898909950247","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2078,"impression_count":1929277,"like_count":5693,"quote_count":510,"reply_count":763,"retweet_count":510},"text":"Over the last few months, we’ve made significant progress in reducing the effectiveness of distillation attacks against Claude.\n\nIn this post, we explain how: https://t.co/uWiRSLBuOS","url":"https://x.com/AnthropicAI/status/2109795898909950247"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109781635897905152"]},"author_id":"1745106082790318080","created_at":"2026-10-12T23:01:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109781638322299135"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/Fd6ktmWIYm","end":301,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2109781638322299135/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109781635897905152","start":278,"url":"https://t.co/Fd6ktmWIYm"}]},"id":"2109781638322299135","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":23,"impression_count":20496,"like_count":89,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":6},"text":"HVLP (High Very Low Profile) is an electrodeposited copper foil engineered with an extraordinarily smooth bonding surface on the side that attaches to the resin or dielectric layer, departing from the naturally rough surface characteristic of conventional copper foil. Designed https://t.co/Fd6ktmWIYm","url":"https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2109781638322299135"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109780434976665600"]},"author_id":"86351835","created_at":"2026-10-12T22:57:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109780446372667802"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/4H6qpltWpX","end":275,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/jackclarkSF/status/2109780446372667802/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109780434976665600","start":252,"url":"https://t.co/4H6qpltWpX"}]},"id":"2109780446372667802","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":60,"impression_count":13295,"like_count":197,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":29,"retweet_count":14},"text":"I will be giving the Per Jacobsson Foundation Lecture at the IMF conference in Thailand on Saturday, during which I'm going to make the case that we are entering a period of massive, sudden change catalyzed by the advancing capabilities of AI systems. https://t.co/4H6qpltWpX","url":"https://x.com/jackclarkSF/status/2109780446372667802"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109750005309255681"]},"author_id":"2939913921","created_at":"2026-10-12T20:56:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109750198675390499"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/jTsBUwz3oG","end":300,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/natolambert/status/2109750198675390499/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109750005309255681","start":277,"url":"https://t.co/jTsBUwz3oG"}]},"id":"2109750198675390499","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":337,"impression_count":25300,"like_count":354,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":35},"text":"This is the best piece I’ve read to date on the Chinese data economy for LLMs, and how it compares to the US counterparts (summarized by Mercor, Surge, and Handshake having the biggest network, SUPPLY, but also many companies with specialized services, in the form of RL-ready https://t.co/jTsBUwz3oG","url":"https://x.com/natolambert/status/2109750198675390499"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109720992784199680"]},"author_id":"1745106082790318080","created_at":"2026-10-12T19:00:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109720997888655601"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/s0s6anesjb","end":303,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2109720997888655601/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109720992784199680","start":280,"url":"https://t.co/s0s6anesjb"}]},"id":"2109720997888655601","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":23,"impression_count":23923,"like_count":123,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":10},"text":"BSPD breaks a lot of the toolbox used for yield, fault isolation, inspection. BSPD adds new challenges for teardowns too, but we're getting pretty good at it. We present: Wildcat Lake, Intel 18A.\n\nAre you a passionate, high-achieving engineer with skills in architecture, design, h